<title>USA: Terra completes Huntting acquisition.</title>
<headline>Terra completes Huntting acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY, Iowa 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Terra Industries Inc said Tuesday it completed its acquisition of Huntting Elevator Co, based in Austin, Minnesota.</p>
<p>Terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Huntting sells fertilizers, crop protection products and livestock feed, and serves as a grain merchandiser.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
